//* NAME: TK5.ASM($$$INDEX)
//*
//* Desc: Short index of members in this PDS with sources
//*       The jobs for assembly and link are in TK5.CNTL
//*       The membernames can be recognized with the name
//*       of the source member in this library suffixed with '$'
