           3390 and 9345                                   ×          ×
BLKSPTRK   Physical blocks per DASD track calculater       ×          ×
BYPASCRN   SVC Screening routine                           ×          ×
BYPASSNQ   SCRATCH/RENAME a data set without ENQ           ×+BYPASUPD ×
